  "html": "<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col col-8\"><h2>Tape Splicer</h2><figure><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Tape-Splicer-b.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><div class=\"center\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\n<li>Processes ~1.5 inch (38 mm) wide tape from 24 inch (610 mm) OD reels</li>\n<li>Removes defects from 2 inch to 50 feet long (51 mm to 15.2 m)</li>\n<li>Uses heat and pressure to bond 1.5 inch (38 mm) long splice</li>\n<li>Applies tape over splice region</li>\n<li>Logs and marks each splice</li>\n<li>Defect removed in &lt; 30 seconds</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"col col-4\">\n\t\t\t<nav class=\"side-nav\"><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Specialty Machines</h3><ul><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/specialty-machines/off-axis-laminator/\">Off-Axis Laminator</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/specialty-machines/tool-wrapper-and-sealer/\">Tool Wrapper and Sealer</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/specialty-machines/motion-platform-relay-machine/\">Motion Platform / Relay Machine</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/specialty-machines/ndt-ir-camera-motion-platform/\">NDT IR Camera Motion Platform</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/specialty-machines/foam-cutting-machine/\">Foam Cutting Machine</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/specialty-machines/noodle-former-radius-filler/\">Noodle Former / Radius Filler</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/specialty-machines/ply-kitting-machine/\">Ply Kitting Machine</a></li><li class=\"current\"><a href=\"/composites-automation/specialty-machines/tape-splicer/\">Tape Splicer</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/specialty-machines/thermoplastic-filament-winding/\">Thermoplastic Filament Winding</a></li></ul></nav>\n</div></div><h3>Machine Images</h3><div class=\"gallery\"><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Tape-Splicer-b.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Tape-Splicer-b-300x199.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"199\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Tape-Splicer-a.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Tape-Splicer-a-300x213.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"213\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>"
